      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Tyson Foods, the world’s largest meat‑producing company, has its headquarters in Springdale, making the city a key player in global food supply.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Springdale%2C_Arkansas",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Shiloh Museum of Ozark History, housed in a former schoolhouse, chronicles the region’s early settlers and the city’s evolution.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
